<title>UK: LLoyds extends gains after meeting.</title>
<headline>LLoyds extends gains after meeting.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lloyds TSB Group Plc extended early  gains on Friday after an upbeat analysts meeting followed the company's  half-year results.</p>
<p>The shares rose 46-1/2p to 722p in active trade of 7.6 million shares.</p>
